        di langit-langit mulut. Dengan cara ini komodo dapat mendeteksi bangkai dari
        jarak 4-9,5 km.
      en: The Komodo dragon's tongue is long, yellow and forked. The dragon flicks
        it out to pick up scent particles from the air and carries them to the Jacobson's
