  - hotspotId: gigi
    partName: Rahang
    localPosition: {x: -0.11829242, y: -0.02253433, z: -0.08184914}
    visibleFrom: 1
    title:
      id: Gigi Berlapis Besi
      en: Iron-coated teeth
    regionalTerm: 
    material:
      id: Gigi bergerigi berujung jingga (lapisan kaya besi); pada model 48 gigi
        tampak
      en: Serrated teeth with orange, iron-rich tips; 48 teeth shown on the model
    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Komodo punya sekitar 60 gigi bergerigi seperti gigi hiu, panjangnya sampai
        2,5 cm, yang diganti kira-kira setiap 40 hari. Penelitian tahun 2024 menemukan
        lapisan kaya besi berwarna jingga di ujung dan gerigi giginya. Lapisan ini
        menjaga gigi tetap tajam untuk merobek mangsa besar seperti rusa timor, babi
        hutan, dan kerbau.
      en: Komodo dragons have about 60 serrated, shark-like teeth up to 2.5 cm long,
        replaced roughly every 40 days. A 2024 study found an orange, iron-rich coating
        on the tips and serrations of the teeth. It keeps them sharp for tearing
        large prey such as Timor deer, wild boar and water buffalo.
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    narrationID: {fileID: 0}
    narrationEN: {fileID: 0}
    pronunciation: {fileID: 0}
